  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "View PDF",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Tender documentation should provide bidders with background information about the goods or services required, as well as setting out the detailed requirements.",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Tender documentation will typically comprise instructions to bidders with the conditions to participate.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "As with all aspects of the Procurement Journey, the activities at this stage must be carried out in a carefully managed manner that supports the Principles of Procurement .",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It is your responsibility to ensure these requirements are met.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Guidance on conduct is therefore contained within the subsequent Issue Documents stations.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Electronic Tendering",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Electronic tendering enables you to manage the procurement process online. It:",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "reduces the paperwork involved in tendering exercises",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "provides an electronic audit trail",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "allows you to provide a faster response to questions and points of clarification during the tender process.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It is best practice to use PCS-Tender , if the Buyer has access to it, as PCS-Tender manages the administrative aspects of the tendering process.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If PCS-Tender is being used, the relevant project code should be entered into the Contract Notice on Public Contracts Scotland (PCS). Alternatively, if the Buyer does not have access to PCS-Tender, then Public Contracts Scotland – Advertising should be used throughout the process.",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Publication of Documents",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Invitation to Tender documents must be:",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "offered on the internet",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "unrestricted",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "with full direct access",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "non-discriminatory in manner",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "free of charge.",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "These documents must be available from the date of publication of a Contract Notice , or the date on which the Invitation to Confirm Interest was sent.",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Only those bidders who have passed the appropriate selection stage will be allowed to tender in a two-stage procedure.",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "For the following procedures:",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Restricted Procedure",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Competitive Dialogue Procedure",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Innovation Partnership",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Competitive Procedure with Negotiation",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An invitation to submit a tender must be issued to selected bidders at the same time and in writing. However, the open procedure allows for ITTs to be issued on request at any point prior to the date set for submission of tenders.",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Timescales",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents",
        "Timescales"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Where ITT documents cannot be issu ed electronically for example, because the contract is of a nature which requires the use of specialised tools and/or files, other trans mission means can be used. The tender time limit should be increased by five days except where permitted in a case of duly substantiated urgency .",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents",
        "Timescales"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Timescales for each procedure can be found in the relevant procurement route station.",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents",
        "Timescales"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00031",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Deadlines must be extended where:",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents",
        "Timescales"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00032",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "additional information requested by a bidder is not supplied at least six days before the deadline. This information must have been requested by the bidder in good time and is of significant importance.",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents",
        "Timescales"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00033",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "significant changes are made to the procurement documents. This will be reduced to four days when the accelerated procedure is used.",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents",
        "Timescales"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00034",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The length of extension must be proportionate to the complexity of the change and/or the additional information being provided.",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents",
        "Timescales"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00035",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "To proceed with a tender extension the necessary approval must be obtained in accordance with your internal governance and legislation. If the date is amended, the new date should be notified to all tenderers. If any tenderer have already submitted a bid they should be given the opportunity of withdrawing their original bid. They can then submit a revised bid in line with the extended tender deadline.",
      "ordinal": 35,
      "heading_path": [
        "Electronic Tendering",
        "Publication of Documents",
        "Timescales"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    }
  ],
